| `{{ src.silver.table }}` | {{ src.silver.rules_summary }} | {{ src.silver.removed_text }} |
{% endfor %}

!!! info "ON VIOLATION options"
    Omit `ON VIOLATION DROP ROW` to keep violating rows but record violation counts.{% for w in warn_rules %} The `{{ w.rule }}` rule in `{{ w.table }}` uses this approach.{% endfor %} Use `ON VIOLATION FAIL UPDATE` to stop pipeline execution if violations occur.

